<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - July 9.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - July 9.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airports in Russia's North Caucasus and the Krasnoyarsk region in Western Siberia may be closed for short periods on July 9 due to heavy thunderstorms, the Russian Weather Service said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The probability of closure was 75 percent, it said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
